F("ec2-auto-scaling-lb-auto-register-deregister", "behavior",
  "With a load balancer attached, instances that the group launches are registered with the load balancer automatically, and instances it terminates are deregistered automatically; you do not register instances one by one.",
  "Do you have to register each new Auto Scaling instance with the load balancer?",
  ["automatically registered with the load balancer", "automatically deregistered from the load balancer"],
  (LB, "When you use Elastic Load Balancing with your Auto Scaling group, it's not necessary to register individual EC2 instances with the load balancer. Instances that are launched by your Auto Scaling group are automatically registered with the load balancer. Likewise, instances that are terminated by your Auto Scaling group are automatically deregistered from the load balancer."),
  ["2.2.S2", "2.2.S4"]),
